        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 4,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Also he made the molten sea of ten cubits from brim to brim. It was round, five cubits high, and thirty cubits in circumference.",
      "ko": "또 바다를 부어 만들었으니 직경이 십 규빗이요 그 모양이 둥글며 그 고는 다섯 규빗이요 주위는 삼십 규빗 줄을 두를만하며",
      "source_text_hash": "45713482b3356ec02ea1b3a4e4935a95d6786d9196efba600521351972971deb",
      "translation_text_hash": "2a1a4b961cd4cb75100a29a21e420eab29f81aa5c4aedbbcb88f7b28b8a9e316",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
